('SS1', 'science', 'Agriculture', 'Soil fertility', 'Which nutrient is especially associated with leafy vegetative growth in crops?', 'Phosphorus', 'Potassium', 'Nitrogen', 'Calcium', 'C', 'Nitrogen supports chlorophyll formation and vigorous vegetative growth.', 'easy', '1', 'true'),
