('SS1', 'science', 'Physical Education', 'Sportsmanship', 'An official makes a decision a player disagrees with. Which response demonstrates sportsmanship?', 'Insult the official loudly.', 'Leave the field without permission.', 'Retaliate against an opponent.', 'Raise a respectful query through the team captain when appropriate.', 'D', 'Respectful communication and use of the proper process maintain fair play.', 'easy', '1', 'true'),

