('SS1', 'science', 'Health Education', 'Mental health', 'A learner feels persistently overwhelmed and unable to cope. What is an appropriate first step?', 'Keep the problem secret from every trusted person.', 'Stop eating and sleeping until school improves.', 'Use another person’s medication.', 'Seek support from a trusted adult or qualified health professional.', 'D', 'Trusted adults and qualified professionals can help assess the situation and connect the learner to suitable support.', 'medium', '1', 'true'),
